@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

# Demo data for an EMPTY database: 5 fuel types, 10 stations (BRSM addresses), prices.
# Run All once after "docker compose down -v" + first API start; a second run returns 400 (duplicates).

### Fuel type A95BIO
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/fuel-types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "A95BIO",
  "name": "Бензин А95 біо"
}

